experiment_game/data/subjects/
experiment_game/data/models/
experiment_game/data/offline_replay/
experiment_game/data/sim_subjects/

# ---- 训练输出 / 权重 / prob dump（约 490MB）----
code/train_lab/out/
code/adapt_engine/results/
**/out/
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.onnx
**/*.pkl
**/*.joblib
**/*.pid
**/System.Collections.Specialized.OrderedDictionary
**/*_X.npy
**/*_X_noz.npy
**/_cache_*.npy
*.npy
# 保留体量很小的 epochs（自采数据派生的训练样本，约 8MB）
!experiment_game/data/epochs/**/*.npy

